call_translation = "Hey. So you may have heard of me. They call me a wizard out there. In this acute hexahedron? I am simply but a choleric disciple, PREPARED to perpetuate the cycle of capitalism under the rule of the totalitarian leaders. Life is hard. I understand. As someone living in my patriarch's understructure, life truly can get hard. However! Fret not. I am here and willing to make a communion. Prepare yourself. 345897. I will be thanking you shortly."
